{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q20.material.recovered", "text": "某化学兴趣小组设计了一个课外实验，目的是测定一定质量的某铜铝混合物中的铜的质量分数。且希望实验尽量不产生有毒气体，实验方案如下所示：", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2255, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2321, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q20"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.407.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q20"], "word_count": 66, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "huaxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2255, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2321, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "res