{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q21.material.recovered", "text": "某教师在必修教材《化学2》“生活中两种常见的有机物”第一课时教学中，用“乙醇”设计了以下教学过程，并展开教学：通过中国的酒文化引入课题→观察乙醇，总结物理性质→复习回忆乙醇的分子式→根据碳原子可形成四个共价键的原则，提出乙醇的两种可能结构（即和）→实验验证：乙醇和钠的反应→得出乙醇的分子结构，介绍羟基官能团→实验验证：铜丝在酒精灯的内焰和外焰移动→介绍乙醇的催化氧化，启发联想断键方式→介绍有机化学中的氧化反应→得出醇类物质的通性→介绍乙醇的性质和用途→布置作业，制作一份关于酗酒危害的海报。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2473, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2720, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 21, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q21"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.407.r001", "ntce.outline.407.r008", "ntce.outline.407.r009", "ntce.outline.407.r021"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q21"], "word_count": 247, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "huaxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2473, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2720, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/201