{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q22.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下列三段材料，根据要求完成任务。材料一 《普通高中化学课程标准（实验）》关于“离子反应”的内容标准：知道酸、碱、盐在溶液中能发生电离。材料二 某版高中必修教材《化学1》第二章第2节“离子反应”的部分内容：材料三 教学对象为高一年级学生。学生在初三化学中已经学习了离子、盐酸、硫酸、氢氧化钠、氢氧化钙、氯化钠等知识。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2819, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2978, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 22, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q22"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s3.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.407.r001", "ntce.outline.407.r008", "ntce.outline.407.r009", "ntce.outline.407.r012", "ntce.outline.407.r013", "ntce.outline.407.r014", "ntce.outline.407.r021"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.huaxue.2019a.q22"], "word_count": 159, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "huaxue", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "023590497f76a66f990be8b7dea2c43bff4239f0c010ba9363de0ba2ef3fb0f4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2819, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2978, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教